{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "oan-da-advisors",
    "name": "OAN DA Advisors",
    "description": "Advisor directory: Ministry of Agriculture subject-matter experts DAs reference for specialist advice.\n\nBase path: /api/v1/da-services\n\n## Endpoints\n- POST /advisors: add an advisor (Administrator only)\n- GET /advisors: list, with q / expertise / region / woreda / status / limit / start\n- GET /advisors/{id}: one advisor\n\n## Who sees what\n- Administrator: adds advisors and sees the whole directory.\n- Supervisor, Executive: read the whole directory.\n- Development Agent: reads only the advisors of their own Woreda(s). An advisor of another Woreda is 404.\n\n## Run order\n1. Set admin_usr / admin_pwd, da_usr / da_pwd and sup_usr / sup_pwd in the environment.\n2. Run folder 0 (the three logins store access_token, da_access_token, sup_access_token).\n3. Run folders 1 to 5 in order. 'Add advisor' stores advisor_id; 'Add advisor in another Woreda' stores other_advisor_id.\n\n## Test data\n- region_name / woreda_name: the Region and Woreda of the DA in da_usr, as master-data names (the Add Advisor form saves names).\n- other_region_name / other_woreda_name: a Woreda the DA is not assigned to.\n\nRequests use the Admin token (access_token) unless the request sets its own.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
